# Template for a local release keystore. Copy to keystore.properties (git-ignored)
# and uncomment, replacing every placeholder. Without this file (and without the
# CI KEYSTORE_* environment variables) the release build stays unsigned.
#
# storeFile points at the JKS; a relative path is resolved from the root project.
# storeFile=/absolute/path/to/<your-release>.jks
# storePassword=<store-password-placeholder>
# keyAlias=<key-alias-placeholder>
# keyPassword=<key-password-placeholder>
